# The build context of the server images in deploy/ is the repository root. It holds only what
# the GameService and SimulationWorker projects compile and copy: the shared build settings, the
# server projects, the shared .NET code with its generated World data, and the authored content.
# The Unity client, the art sources, the tools, the tests, and local build output stay out.
**

!.editorconfig
!Directory.Build.props
!global.json
!content/**
!src/Server/**
!src/Shared/**

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.meta
src/Shared/*/Client/
src/Shared/*/Editor/
src/Shared/*/Schema~/
